    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1403">

                <pb facs="1191" n="1087" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg1087"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 819.77/144.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi><anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d1403-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Panama</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-01-27">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 27, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s January 21. Commission’s report to be forwarded tomorrow recommends
                    disapproval of contract especially on the <pb facs="1192" n="1088"
                        xml:id="pg1088"/> ground of indefiniteness of its provisions which render
                    impracticable proper consideration of its technical merits.</p>
                <p>Panaman President informs me that he will prolong for twenty days session of
                    Assembly.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dodge</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1403-f1" n="2" type="source" xml:id="d1403-f1-content">
                <p>A copy of this telegram was sent to the Secretary of War on January 29.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
